WEBVTT

00:05:59.605 --> 00:06:01.190
Now giving circle,

00:06:01.232 --> 00:06:03.484
is not about me or you.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.612
It's about us together.

00:06:08.406 --> 00:06:11.534
And once we have shared and discussed,

00:06:11.534 --> 00:06:14.787
the third step is to give with trust.

00:06:15.913 --> 00:06:17.706
Because in a giving circle,

00:06:17.706 --> 00:06:20.584
we give altogether
to a shared pot of funding

00:06:20.584 --> 00:06:24.797
before even knowing
where that money is going to go.

00:06:25.548 --> 00:06:26.924
We trust each other,

00:06:26.966 --> 00:06:30.803
and that trust extends
to the groups that we're funding.